py-1.5 rounded-lg font-medium transition-all bg-gray-800 text-gray-400 hover:text-white\">National (SSC/UPSC)</button><button class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg font-medium transition-all bg-gray-800 text-gray-400 hover:text-white\">Banking &amp; IBPS</button><button class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg font-medium transition-all bg-gray-800 text-gray-400 hover:text-white\">Railway RRB</button><button class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg font-medium transition-all bg-gray-800 text-gray-400 hover:text-white\">CTET / UPTET</button><button class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg font-medium transition-all bg-gray-800 text-gray-400 hover:text-white\">State Exams</button></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-2xl p-5 space-y-4 shadow-xl\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-800 pb-3\"><div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-white text-base\">SSC (CGL / CHSL / MTS / GD)</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-400\">Staff Selection Commission</p></div><span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase font-semibold text-blue-400 bg-blue-950 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-blue-800\">national</span></div><div class=\"space-y-3\"><div class=\"bg-gray-950 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-3.5 space-y-1 text-xs\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"font-bold text-white\">SSC Passport Photo</span><span class=\"font-mono bg-gray-800 text-emerald-400 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px]\">JPG, JPEG</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-1 text-gray-300 font-mono pt-1\"><div>Size: <strong class=\"text-emerald-400\">20<!-- -->–<!-- -->50<!-- --> KB</strong></div><div>Dim: <strong class=\"text-blue-300\">200<!-- --> × <!-- -->230<!-- --> px</strong></div></div><p class=\"text-[11px] text-gray-400 pt-1 border-t border-gray-800/60\">White background mandatory. Dimensions 3.5 cm x 4.5 cm (200 x 230 px).</p></div><div class=\"bg-gray-950 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-3.5 space-