-blue-950 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-blue-800\">banking</span></div><div class=\"space-y-3\"><div class=\"bg-gray-950 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-3.5 space-y-1 text-xs\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"font-bold text-white\">IBPS Passport Photo</span><span class=\"font-mono bg-gray-800 text-emerald-400 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px]\">JPG, JPEG</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-1 text-gray-300 font-mono pt-1\"><div>Size: <strong class=\"text-emerald-400\">20<!-- -->–<!-- -->50<!-- --> KB</strong></div><div>Dim: <strong class=\"text-blue-300\">200<!-- --> × <!-- -->230<!-- --> px</strong></div></div><p class=\"text-[11px] text-gray-400 pt-1 border-t border-gray-800/60\">Size 20 KB to 50 KB. 200 x 230 pixels.</p></div><div class=\"bg-gray-950 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-3.5 space-y-1 text-xs\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"font-bold text-white\">IBPS Signature</span><span class=\"font-mono bg-gray-800 text-emerald-400 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px]\">JPG, JPEG</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-1 text-gray-300 font-mono pt-1\"><div>Size: <strong class=\"text-emerald-400\">10<!-- -->–<!-- -->20<!-- --> KB</strong></div><div>Dim: <strong class=\"text-blue-300\">140<!-- --> × <!-- -->60<!-- --> px</strong></div></div><p class=\"text-[11px] text-gray-400 pt-1 border-t border-gray-800/60\">Black ink only. Size 10 KB to 20 KB.</p></div><div class=\"bg-gray-950 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-3.5 space-y-1 text-xs\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"font-bold text-white\">IBPS Left Thumb Impression</span><span class=\"font-mono bg-gray-800 text-emerald-400 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px]\">JPG, JPEG</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-1 text-gray-300 font-mono pt-1\"><div>Size: <strong class=\"text-emerald-400\">20<!-- -->–<!-- -->50<!-- --> KB</strong></div><div>Dim: <strong class=\"text-blue-300\">240<!-- --> × <!-- -->240<!-- --> px</strong></div></div><p class=\"text-[11px] text-gray-400 pt-1 border-t border-gray-800/60\">Blue or black ink on white paper. 240 x 240 pixels (3 cm x 3 cm).</p></div><div class=\"bg-gray-950 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-3.5 space-y-1 text-xs\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"font-bold text-white\">IBPS Handwritten Declaration</span><span class=\"font-mono bg-gray-800 text-emerald-400 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px]\">JPG, JPEG</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-1 text-gray-300 font-mono pt-1\"><div>Size: <strong class=\"text-emerald-400\">50<!-- -->–<!-- -->100<!-- --> KB</strong></div><div>Dim: <strong class=\"text-blue-300\">800<!-- --> × <!-- -->400<!-- --> px</strong></div></div><p class=\"text-[11px] text-gray-400 pt-1 border-t border-gray-800/60\">Handwritten statement in English on white paper with black ink. 800 x 400 pixels.</p></div></div><a class=\"block text-center w-full py-2 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl transition-all shadow-md\" href=\"/\">Use Requirements in Resizer Tool →</a></div><div class=\"bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-2xl p-5 space-y-4 shadow-xl\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-800 pb-3\"><div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-white text-base\">Railway (RRB NTPC / Group D / ALP)</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-400\">Railway Recruitment Board</p></div><span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase font-semibold text-blue-400 bg-blue-950 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-blue-800\">railway</span></div><div class=\"space-y-3\"><div class=\"bg-gray-950 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-3.5 space-y-1 text-xs\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"font-bold text-white\">RRB Passport Photo</span><span class=\"font-mono bg-gray-800 text-emerald-400 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px]\">JPG, JPEG</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-1 t